                  <th style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 18px 24px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 2px solid #7dd3fc; color: #075985;">移动网络可用带宽</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e0f2fe;">
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">🇭🇰 香港 HK 手机特化专线</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">35 ms - 52 ms</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #16a34a;">&lt; 0.5% (平滑)</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold;">120 Mbps - 180 Mbps</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e0f2fe; background: #f8fafc;">
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">🇹🇼 台湾 TW 动态抗阻专线</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">48 ms - 65 ms</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #16a34a;">&lt; 0.8%</td>
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px; font-weight: bold;">100 Mbps - 150 Mbps</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e0f2fe;">
                  <td style="padding: 18px 24px;">🇯🇵 日本 JP 移动基站优选</td>
